# Plaintext fallback that the trivy-action entrypoint picks up
# unconditionally from the workspace root. Keep in sync with
# .trivyignore.yaml — every line MUST be justified in that file.
#
# Re-evaluate any time the web image's nginx base Alpine is bumped, or by
# 2026-09-01 at the latest.

# CVE-2026-6732 — libxml2 DoS via crafted XSD-validated document.
# Reachable only via nginx's ngx_http_xslt_module (xslt_stylesheet directive).
# apps/web/nginx.conf serves static files only, so the code path is dead here.
# Alpine 3.21 mirrors do not yet ship the fixed 2.13.9-r1.
CVE-2026-6732
